ter in the Necralisk (Deimos). Catch Lobotriscid on the Cambion Drift surface during Vome.  Also drops from Isolation Vault Bounties in the Cambion Drift.","Se utiliza para adherirse a otras formas de vida con fines alimentarios y para inyectarles anticoagulantes y esporas.\n\nFuente: Obtenido de un pez Lobotriscid con Hija en el Necralisk (Deimos). Captura el Lobotriscid en la superficie de Deriva Cambion durante Vome. También se obtiene de los contratos de la Bóveda de Aislamiento en Deriva Cambion."],"img":"storeicons-fishing-deimos-parts-deimosinfestedfishgpart","planets":[],"sources":[],"usedIn":["Weapons/Infested/Melee/Nunchaku/InfNunchuck/InfNunchuck"],"refs":{"Weapons/Infested/Melee/Nunchaku/InfNunchuck/InfNunchuck":{"tab":"arsenal","slug":"pulmonars","slugEs":"pulmonars","name":["Pulmonars","Pulmonars"],"img":"storeicons-weapons-meleeweapons-weapons-infnunchuck"}}},"pyrol":{"slug":"pyrol","slugEs":"pirol","name":["Pyrol","Pirol"],"desc":["A tarnished, brittle metal.\n\nLocation: Plains of Eidolon (Earth) from Red Mining Veins and Thumpers","Un metal frágil y sin lustrar.\n\nUbicación: Llanuras de Eidolon (Tierra), en las vetas mineras rojas y con los Pistones"],"img":"storeicons-gems-eidolon-commonorea","planets":[["Earth","Tierra"]],"sources":[{"k":"enemy","who":"Tusk Thumper Doma","eff":33.36},{"k":"enemy","who":"Tusk Thumper Bull","eff":25.02},{"k":"enemy","who":"Tusk Thumper","eff":16.68},{"k":"enemy","who":"Narmer Thumper Doma","eff":33.36},{"k":"enemy","who":"Narmer Thumper Bull","eff":25.02},{"k":"enemy","who":"Narmer Thumper","eff":16.68}],"usedIn":[],"refs":{}},"riven-sliver":{"slug":"riven-sliver","slugEs":"fragmento-de-agrietado","name":["Riven Sliver","Fragmento de Agrietado"],"desc":["A fragment of a sundered Riven. It is known that, with enough slivers, Palladino is capable of reforging a complete Riven. Find her in the Iron Wake (Earth) after completing The Chains of Harrow quest.\n\nLocation: Eximus units and Requiem Relics","Un fragmento de